<title>USA: Wisconsin $115 mln GOs won by Morgan Stanley.</title>
<headline>Wisconsin $115 mln GOs won by Morgan Stanley.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley &amp; Co said Wednesday it won $115 million Wisconsin general obligation bonds at a true interest cost of 5.559 percent.</p>
</text>
